# Waived findings for the CI Trivy image scan. Each entry MUST carry a
# justification and a re-check condition. A finding with an available fix that
# is reachable in the running server is NEVER waived here - it is fixed.

# CVE-2026-33671 - picomatch ReDoS via crafted extglob patterns.
# The vulnerable 4.0.3 is only DECLARED in the manifest of vitest (a
# devDependency, build/test tooling). pnpm resolves the actual installed
# picomatch to the fixed 4.0.4 (see pnpm-lock.yaml), and vitest never runs in
# the production server, so the glob matcher is unreachable at runtime. Waived
# until vitest bumps its declared picomatch past 4.0.4; re-check on the next
# vitest upgrade.
CVE-2026-33671
